// Two once-only [choice-only] choices, no variables. Compiled to
// choices.ink.json via inklecate. Uses only the plain bracket-text
// choice form ("* [choice-only] more text") — the "text[choice]more"
// start+choice-only combo compiles to weave/tunnel machinery ($r
// variable pointer redirection) that this fixture deliberately doesn't
// implement.
Hello, traveler.

* [Go north] You went north.
* [Go south] You went south.

You made your choice.
-> END
